ue` is passed (see [the comparison](https://github.com/EpicWink/cpython/compare/threading-queue-shutdown...EpicWink:cpython:threading-queue-shutdown-immediate-consume) for what's changed).\r\n\r\n* `task_done` and `join` will now not raise after calling `shutdown(immediate=True)`, rather they'll behave as if on a finished queue (`join` returns, `task_done` raises the standard `ValueError`)\r\n* Potentially public `is_shutdown` boolean attribute\r\n\r\nThis PR includes and modified changes from #104225.\n\n<!-- gh-issue-number: gh-96471 -->\n* Issue: gh-96471\n<!-- /gh-issue-number -->\n\r\n\r\n<!-- readthedocs-preview cpython-previews start -->\r\n----\n:books: Documentation preview :books:: https://cpython-previews--104750.org.readthedocs.build/\n\r\n<!-- readthedocs-preview cpython-previews end -->","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2023-05-22T14:47:40Z","updated_at":"2024-04-11T01:09:39Z","closed_at":"2024-02-10T04:58:30Z","merged_at":"2024-02-10T04:58:30Z","merge_commit_sha":"b2d9d134dcb5633deebebf2b0118cd4f7ca598a2","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"EpicWink:threading-queue-shutdown-immediate-consume","ref":"threading-queue-shutdown-immediate-consume","repo":{"id":180748381,"node_id":"MDEwOlJlcG9zaXRvcnkxODA3NDgzODE=","name":"cpython","full_name":"EpicWink/cpython","owner":{"login":"EpicWink","id":25142085,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1MTQyMDg1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25142085?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/EpicWink","html_url":"https://github.com/EpicWink","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EpicWink/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EpicWink/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EpicWink/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EpicWink/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EpicWink/subscriptions","or